## Slide 2

Page Values 

Allows programmatic setting of items to the Values Dictionary for a Page and all of its Children (Hubs and/or Spokes)
Values set via .NET script Editor
Retrieve data from TrakSYS
API is Available
Add to Values Dictionary
Occurs before Page Class Script is Executed

