## Slide 5

Instances Editor

## Slide 6

Page Instances 

Allows a single Page Definition to be rendered multiple times in the User Interface
Instances based on one of three modes:
System by Area Key: Get one Instance per System in an Area
Page Definition Instance: Configure instances with IDs and Keys
Custom Script: Use API and SQL to build a list of Instances
Instances set via .NET script Editor
Retrieve data from TrakSYS
API is Available
Add to Instances List
Occurs before Values Script is Executed

